      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904132
    m_Localized: Task Echo Count 1<sprite=194>2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834096738304
    m_Localized: A Vast Preference
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904128
    m_Localized: '"The Vast one seems to favor pink slimes most of all. If you gather
      up enough of their power I am sure your connection to combat will increase
      and this particular buff will become stronger" - Eva'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904129
    m_Localized: Combat Echo Count 1<sprite=194>2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904130
    m_Localized: Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904131
    m_Localized: '"Your connection to The Vast One''s realm is strong. It seems to
      get stronger the more you do here. Why not complete some tasks? I can always
      use more radishes for my Jam" - Eva'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8818639323414528
    m_Localized: Overwhelming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8818639323414529
    m_Localized: '"With great power comes great... Nah I am just kidding, but to
      improve your connection further is going to require a lot more work than last
      time" - Eva'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8818639323414530
    m_Localized: Task Echo Count 2<sprite=194>3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904133
    m_Localized: Just keep swimming...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904134
    m_Localized: '"You might find yourself on water sometimes but you really shouldn''t
      stay there long its not safe no matter how fast you go" - Gill'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904136
    m_Localized: Gathering winds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904137
    m_Localized: '"The further you go the faster you go" - The Vast One'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904139
    m_Localized: Focus. Speed. I am speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904140
    m_Localized: '"Remind you of anything?" - The Vast One'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904142
    m_Localized: Faster Than Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904143
    m_Localized: Now you're the fastest one alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904145
    m_Localized: Fast & Flora-ous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904146
    m_Localized: "\u201CIf you can harvest faster, we might actually eat before sundown.\u201D
      \u2014 Flora"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904148
    m_Localized: Turbo Tiller Time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904149
    m_Localized: "\u201CPlant-plant, pick-pick\u2014tasks in a clickity-click.\u201D
      \u2014 Tillman"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904151
    m_Localized: "Mildred\u2019s Pre-Pats Protocol"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904152
    m_Localized: "\u201CPats first. Tasks later. I don\u2019t make the rules\u201D
      \u2014 Mildred"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904154
    m_Localized: "Old Timer\u2019s Whirlwind"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904155
    m_Localized: "\u201CDo \u2018em quick, do \u2018em right\u2014blink and you\u2019re
      on the next one\u201D \u2014 The Old Timer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904157
    m_Localized: "Old Timer\u2019s Lightning Round"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904158
    m_Localized: "\u201CFifty chores in the time for five\u201D \u2014 The Old Timer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904160
    m_Localized: "Eva\u2019s Chrono-Sprint"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904161
    m_Localized: "\u201CBent time a smidge. Don\u2019t waste it\u201D \u2014 Eva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904163
    m_Localized: Slime Time Trial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904164
    m_Localized: "\u201CRule one: if it jiggles, it just volunteered\u201D \u2014
      The Old Timer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904166
    m_Localized: Silence the Rattle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904167
    m_Localized: "\u201CBones should rest. Help \u2019em remember\u201D \u2014 The
      Old Timer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904169
    m_Localized: Arcane Disassembly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904170
    m_Localized: "\u201CTarget joints; the rest obey physics\u201D \u2014 Eva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904172
    m_Localized: Cold Ron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904173
    m_Localized: '"That''s how you say it right?" - The Vast One'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904175
    m_Localized: Between Moments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904176
    m_Localized: "\u201CI shaved the gap between your steps. Walk between moments,
      not through them\u201D \u2014 The Vast One"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904178
    m_Localized: Lag, Denied
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904179
    m_Localized: "\u201CDelay is hearsay. Proceed\u201D \u2014 The Vast One"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904181
    m_Localized: Divine Tailwind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904182
    m_Localized: "\u201CI set your shadow ahead of you. Catch it\u201D \u2014 The
      Vast One"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904184
    m_Localized: Authorized Zoomies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904185
    m_Localized: "\u201CYes, that is the official term. Proceed briskly\u201D \u2014
      The Vast One"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904187
    m_Localized: Autopatch Notes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904188
    m_Localized: "\u201CI have approved your hotfix\u2014flesh, compile\u201D \u2014
      The Vast One"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904190
    m_Localized: Regrowth Protocol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904191
    m_Localized: "\u201CLeaves remember their shape; so do You\u2014resume it\u201D
      \u2014 The Vast One"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904193
    m_Localized: Low Simmer Protocol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904194
    m_Localized: "\u201CPower is patient; keep it at whisper heat and let the brew
      decide\u201D \u2014 Eva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904196
    m_Localized: Infusion Confusion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904197
    m_Localized: "\u201CDon\u2019t fear the swirl; fear the stillness\u201D \u2014
      Eva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904199
    m_Localized: Blue-Heat Edge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904200
    m_Localized: "\u201CWrist soft, point firm\u2014crits live in control, not force\u201D
      \u2014 Ivan"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904202
    m_Localized: Grain Sense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904203
    m_Localized: "\u201CEverything\u2019s got a grain\u2014cut with it, then across
      it\u201D \u2014 Ivan"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904205
    m_Localized: Edge Memory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904206
    m_Localized: "\u201CHold the angle you trust and repeat it\u2014precision makes
      its own luck\u201D \u2014 Ivan"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904208
    m_Localized: Single True Cut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904209
    m_Localized: "\u201COne clean line beats five messy ones\u201D \u2014 Ivan"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904211
    m_Localized: Supply Chain Reaction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904212
    m_Localized: "\u201CMore in means more out\u2014alchemy respects volume\u201D
      \u2014 Eva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904214
    m_Localized: 'Requisition: Excess'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904215
    m_Localized: "\u201CYes, I did say all of it\u2014thank me when it multiplies\u201D
      \u2014 Eva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904217
    m_Localized: Capacity Stress Test
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904218
    m_Localized: "\u201CWe will find capacity by exceeding it\u201D \u2014 Eva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904220
    m_Localized: More Begets More
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834121904221
    m_Localized: "\u201CProve the rule of plenty\u2014more begets more\u201D \u2014
      Eva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8817834126098432
    m_Localized: Capacity, Conquered
